1
00:02:20,206 --> 00:02:22,164
看这里 小猫咪!
Here, kitty kitty!

2
00:03:03,914 --> 00:03:04,747
就是现在!
Now!

3
00:03:15,414 --> 00:03:17,164
快去最近的避难所!
Head to the nearest shelter!

4
00:03:18,206 --> 00:03:20,081
那些避难所快要满了
Those shelters are going to fill up soon.

5
00:03:20,122 --> 00:03:21,164
我们只有这么多地方了
They are all we've got.

6
00:03:21,206 --> 00:03:23,164
我们只要顶住戮兽的攻击就行
We just have to hold up the Grimm.

7
00:03:25,872 --> 00:03:30,372
好 是长官 完毕
Okay. Yes. Understood. Over and out.

8
00:03:30,622 --> 00:03:31,747
新的命令?
New orders?

9
00:03:32,914 --> 00:03:33,706
我们走吧
Let's go.

10
00:03:53,872 --> 00:03:56,789
带我们去擎天吧 我们在这里活不下去的
Take us to Atlas, we won't survive down here.

11
00:03:56,997 --> 00:03:58,747
埃隆伍德究竟在干什么?
Why isn't Ironwood doing anything?

12
00:03:58,789 --> 00:03:59,997
带我们去擎天!
Take us to Atlas!

13
00:04:01,164 --> 00:04:03,664
大家请等一下 我们在全力以赴
Please, everyone, we are doing our best.

14
00:04:03,706 --> 00:04:06,581
我们会让你们去安全的地方 请给我们一点时间
We'll get you to safety, just give us a little more time.

15
00:04:09,331 --> 00:04:14,497
擎天 曼特 我知道你们很害怕
Atlas, Mantle, I know you are scared.

16
00:04:15,622 --> 00:04:19,289
我现在和埃隆伍德将军在一起 我们有则消息要告诉你们
I'm here with General Ironwood, and we have a message for you.

17
00:04:20,747 --> 00:04:26,539
他说的话可能难以置信 但都是事实
What he has to say may sound unbelievable, but it is allitrue,

18
00:04:27,581 --> 00:04:31,206
一个古老又可怕的恶魔盘踞在我们王国之外
An ancient and terrible evil lies outside of our kingdom.

19
00:04:31,914 --> 00:04:34,706
它是信标陷落
It was responsible for the destruction of Beacon,

20
00:04:35,122 --> 00:04:38,456
避风港袭击 和最近的曼特城事件的始作俑者
the attack on Haven, and for the recent attacks on Mantle.

21
00:04:39,497 --> 00:04:44,456
这股巨大力量的名字叫做 塞伦
This powerful force goes by the name of Salem.

22
00:04:45,081 --> 00:04:46,539
他公布真相了
He's doing it.

23
00:04:47,789 --> 00:04:52,414
塞伦希望分裂我们 让我们自相残杀
Salem seeks only to divide us, to turn us against each other.

24
00:04:54,331 --> 00:04:56,372
如果她能够激起我们的仇恨
If she can incite hatred in us.

25
00:04:57,039 --> 00:05:00,456
我们就会吸引戮兽 来毁灭我们自己
Then we will lure in the Grimm, and destroy ourselves.

26
00:05:01,831 --> 00:05:04,372
塞伦并不独自行动
Salem herself does not work alone.

27
00:05:05,122 --> 00:05:08,206
她的爪牙已经渗透进我们的城市
Her minions have embedded in our very city.

28
00:05:08,789 --> 00:05:11,164
亚瑟·瓦特和提利安:卡洛斯
Arthur Watts, and Tyrian Callows.

29
00:05:11,747 --> 00:05:14,122
这些人制造了近期的谋杀案
These men are the ones who is responsible for the recent murders

30
00:05:14,164 --> 00:05:16,747
并破坏了供暖设备
in Mantle and for the sabotaging the heating unit.

31
00:05:17,539 --> 00:05:23,664
但我们不能让自己陷入恐惧与惊慌 这正是她所期望的
But we cannot let ourselves give in to fear and panic. That is what she wants.

32
00:05:24,497 --> 00:05:28,539
相反 我们需要团结一致进行反抗
Instead we must unite and fight back together.

33
00:05:29,122 --> 00:05:31,289
需要我们每一个人
Every single one of us.

34
00:05:31,706 --> 00:05:35,164
好了 一列纵队 双手搭在前面的人的肩膀上
Al right, Single file line, place your hands on the shoulders in front of you,

35
00:05:35,206 --> 00:05:37,872
眼睛看前面 动起来 动起来
eyes forward, move, move, move.

36
00:05:38,081 --> 00:05:39,747
给他们看看该怎么做 孩子们
Show them how it's done, kids.

37
00:05:41,664 --> 00:05:43,539
你这招是从哪里学的?
Where did you to learn to do that?

38
00:05:43,706 --> 00:05:46,122
呃 在早上的上学路上?
Uhhh, morning school routes?

39
00:05:46,164 --> 00:05:49,456
朋友们 这就是我为什么不得不把资源
This, my friends, is why I was forced to devert resources

40
00:05:49,497 --> 00:05:52,914
从曼特转移到阿米特通讯塔
from Mantle for the Amity Communication Tower.

41
00:05:53,581 --> 00:05:56,414
阿米特塔目前已经完工且随时可以发射
Amity Tower is now completed and ready to launch.

42
00:05:56,831 --> 00:05:59,456
它将会重建我们的全球通讯
It will reestablish all global communications.

43
00:05:59,497 --> 00:06:03,289
把竞技场改建成一座通讯塔这件事
The colosseum remodeling was a Communications Tower.

44
00:06:03,997 --> 00:06:06,081
詹姆斯是怎么瞒过我的?
How did James get this past me?

45
00:06:06,206 --> 00:06:10,539
同时 我和议会决定把曼特城所有人都疏散到擎天去
...and council and I've decided to evacuate everyone in Mantle to Atlas.

46
00:06:10,914 --> 00:06:12,997
我已经将阿米特的守军调回
I've withdrawn all the defenses from Amity

47
00:06:13,039 --> 00:06:15,872
来协助击退曼特城中的戮兽
in order to assist with repelling Grimm in Mantle.

48
00:06:16,331 --> 00:06:20,831
我们必须求同存异 共同击退这次威胁
We must put aside our differences and band together to defeat this threat

49
00:06:21,372 --> 00:06:24,414
我完全支持埃隆伍德将军的计划
I fully support General Ironwood's plan.

50
00:06:32,581 --> 00:06:35,997
戮兽应该要毁灭我们的敌人 而不是让他们和好!
The Grimm should destroy our enemies, not make them friends!

51
00:06:36,039 --> 00:06:41,414
等等 铁皮人用他的头脑换来了一颗心
Wait, our tin solider's heart has caused him his mind.

52
00:06:42,081 --> 00:06:45,331
你必须让他们的注意力留在曼特城 越久越好
You need to keep their attention in Mantle for as long as possible.

53
00:06:45,831 --> 00:06:48,622
你想要一场比戮兽入侵更大的混乱?
You want more chaos than a Grimm invasion.

54
00:06:49,164 --> 00:06:52,456
说到在树不子中最会捣乱的 非你莫属
If anyone on Remnant could deliver that, wouldn't it be you?

55
00:06:52,497 --> 00:06:57,081
如果你不能到达当地的避难所 请留在原地 支援正在赶来
If you couldn't make it to your local shelters, stay put, help is on the way.

56
00:06:57,456 --> 00:07:01,706
如果你在第17城区 我将会亲自前来救援
And for those of you in sector 17, I'll be seeing you personally.

57
00:07:02,497 --> 00:07:06,664
这么一想 我有个主意
Come to think of it, I do have an idea.

58
00:07:07,456 --> 00:07:10,331
难以置信 这群白痴竟然在这里把我们打败了
I still can't believe those idiots beat us here.

59
00:07:10,372 --> 00:07:12,789
真空王国本是我们的下一个目标
Vacuo was supposed to be the next target.

60
00:07:15,414 --> 00:07:19,081
计划时间表变了 听你说是那个农场男孩拿着神灯?
The timeline has changed, you said the farm boy has the lamp?

61
00:07:20,456 --> 00:07:22,539
找到他 把它夺来
Find him, take it.

62
00:07:24,872 --> 00:07:29,997
不行!先拿到我要的东西 再去做我们想做的事
No! We get what I need first, then we will get what we want.

63
00:07:30,414 --> 00:07:31,331
现在 快去吧
Now, go.

64
00:07:35,789 --> 00:07:40,831
冬之少女已经被埃隆伍德藏了那么多年 今晚我要找到她
Ironwood has been hiding the winter maiden for years, tonight I am going to find her.

65
00:07:44,831 --> 00:07:47,747
将军的想法就跟他的机器人一样好预测
The General is as predictable as his androids

66
00:07:48,206 --> 00:07:49,831
威胁到他的东西
Threaten what he has

67
00:07:50,206 --> 00:07:52,789
他就会立刻赶去保护它
and he'll flock to protect it

68
00:08:02,914 --> 00:08:04,289
进来! 快进来!
Get in! Get in!

69
00:08:19,331 --> 00:08:19,956
嗯?
Huh?

70
00:08:23,664 --> 00:08:25,081
交给我吧!
I've got this!

71
00:08:35,289 --> 00:08:37,497
耶! 哇!
Yeah! Woohoo!

72
00:08:41,747 --> 00:08:44,956
好了 我们只需要将大家带去距离最近的降落区
Alright we just need to get everyone to the closest airpad

73
00:08:45,164 --> 00:08:46,539
最近的着陆点在
the closest LZ is...

74
00:08:51,164 --> 00:08:52,122
那边
There...

75
00:09:50,497 --> 00:09:52,747
Penny! 你没事吧?
Penny! Ah... Are you okay?

76
00:09:53,997 --> 00:09:58,081
哎哟!那对长牙可真危险
Ouch! Those tusks sure are dangerous

77
00:09:58,372 --> 00:09:59,789
是啊 是很危险
They sure are"

78
00:10:01,247 --> 00:10:02,706
我想到一个计划了
I think I have a plan

79
00:10:05,289 --> 00:10:06,081
什么计划?
What is it?

80
00:10:23,872 --> 00:10:26,539
在这边 大骨头
Over here, you big bag of bones

81
00:10:47,081 --> 00:10:47,997
就是现在!
Now!

82
00:11:11,247 --> 00:11:13,247
耶! 她们救了我们!
Yeah! They saved us!

83
00:11:13,289 --> 00:11:15,289
曼特城守护者!
The protector of Mantle!

84
00:11:20,956 --> 00:11:22,122
飞船刚升空
Just sent the ship up

85
00:11:22,164 --> 00:11:23,456
准备去下一个着陆点
Heading to the next LZ

86
00:11:23,872 --> 00:11:24,622
我也是
Ditto

87
00:11:25,039 --> 00:11:25,997
这里也一样
Same here

88
00:11:27,039 --> 00:11:29,831
修小姐 南部郊区已经清理完毕
Miss Hill, the Southern outskirts are clear

89
00:11:30,247 --> 00:11:32,539
应该可以安全疏散民众了
It should be safe to begin evacuations now

90
00:11:32,956 --> 00:11:34,081
干得漂亮 Penny
Great work penny

91
00:11:34,122 --> 00:11:35,081
结束
Over and out

92
00:11:35,664 --> 00:11:37,664
一定要把民众送去安全的地方
Make sure you get these people to safety

93
00:11:37,706 --> 00:11:39,497
我再继续看看有没有漏掉的人
I'm gunna check for any stragglers

94
00:11:50,122 --> 00:11:51,914
罗宾‧修
Robyn Hill

95
00:11:52,539 --> 00:11:56,206
对于一只小鸟来说 你在这儿的影响力可不小
For such a little bird, you have quite the impact around here

96
00:11:57,372 --> 00:12:01,581
为你去到的所有地方都带来希望与笑容
Bringing hope, smile, everywhere you go

97
00:12:04,622 --> 00:12:07,789
真令人不快
I find it upsetting

98
00:12:10,456 --> 00:12:13,122
啊 哈哈哈哈哈啊哈哈
Gah hahahahahaha!

99
00:12:16,581 --> 00:12:20,706
抱歉了卡洛斯 虽然我很想独自解决你
Sorry Callows, I really wanted to pommel you on my own

100
00:12:20,747 --> 00:12:23,539
但将军希望我能分享这份喜悦
But the General insisted I share

101
00:12:23,789 --> 00:12:26,122
跟他结了梁子的不止你一个
Well, you're not the only one with a grudge

102
00:12:26,206 --> 00:12:28,497
你俩都给我去排队吧
You'll both have to get in line

103
00:12:54,456 --> 00:12:57,497
嗯 这么搞的确能达到它的目的
Hmm, this will certainly do the trick

104
00:12:58,414 --> 00:13:00,997
虽然我不会管这叫完工了
Although I wouldn't exactly call it finished

105
00:13:05,414 --> 00:13:07,122
亚瑟·瓦特
Arthur Watts

106
00:13:10,831 --> 00:13:12,206
欢迎
Welcome

107
00:13:15,497 --> 00:13:19,539
原来不是完工了 而是个诱饵
It wasn't finished, it was bait

108
00:13:25,372 --> 00:13:29,956
你知道吗 詹姆斯 这地方一直都是个技术奇迹
You know James, this place has always been a technological marvel

109
00:13:32,747 --> 00:13:33,372
真的
Truly

110
00:13:34,164 --> 00:13:38,039
即使在你做了 呃 这些之前
Even before you went and, uh, did all this

111
00:13:38,706 --> 00:13:41,831
不同的尘晶 整个生态系统
The different types of dust, the biome system

112
00:13:42,039 --> 00:13:46,372
以及 当然 一切需要用来操控它的东西
and of course, everything that goes into controlling them

113
00:13:57,664 --> 00:14:00,497
你从以前开始就很惹人厌
You always were a pain in the ass

114
00:14:28,789 --> 00:14:31,539
詹姆斯 虽然这么说老套了些
At the risk of sounding cliché, James

115
00:14:33,081 --> 00:14:36,122
但我不会让你不战而胜
I won't be going down without a fight